+#### `all-workspaces`
+
+<sup>Since: next release</sup>
+
+By default, the overview shows the active workspace together with the other
+workspaces above and below it. Set `all-workspaces=false` to show only the
+active workspace. Other workspaces remain unchanged and are not rendered in
+the overview.
+
+```kdl
+overview all-workspaces=false {
+}
+```
+
 #### `backdrop-color`
 
 Set the backdrop color behind workspaces in the overview.
